  "semanticsNotes": [
    "U32 operations use exact ni_template forms including total division/modulus and shifts >=32.",
    "Nat checked runtime remains 48-bit immediate with fail-stop overflow; subtraction saturates.",
    "Cmp results use descriptor-bound CID_LT/EQ/GT, not integer compare ordinals.",
    "Array result pairs own original array and retained/copied/replaced value per nc_array_value.",
    "ANode destructure evaluates low before high; high releases parent. ALeaf explicitly blk_free after extracting its value.",
    "F32 uses original bit reinterpretation, libm conversions, parsing/showing; no host double-value replacement.",
